---
import SectionTitle from '@/shared/components/ui/SectionTitle.astro'
---

<section id="historia" class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
  <SectionTitle eyebrow="Desde El Choro, La Paz" title="38 Años de Historia" />
  <p
    class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-center font-sans leading-relaxed text-theme-cream/60"
    data-reveal
  >
    Desde sus comienzos en El Choro, La Paz, Trio Misión ha reunido a distintas
    generaciones de músicos y ha compartido su mensaje en Bolivia y otros países.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4" data-reveal>
    <a class="story-link story-link-primary" href="/historia">Leer nuestra historia</a>
    <a class="story-link story-link-secondary" href="/giras">Giras y presentaciones</a>
  </div>

</section>

<style>
  .story-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    padding: .7rem 1.2rem;
    font-size: .65rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease, color .25s ease;
  }

  .story-link:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

  .story-link-primary {
    color: var(--color-theme-ink);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #e2c88e, #a78345);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgb(199 168 107 / 18%);
  }

  .story-link-secondary {
    color: var(--color-theme-gold);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(199 168 107 / 34%);
  }

  .story-link-secondary:hover { color: var(--color-theme-cream); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(199 168 107 / 70%); }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .story-link { transition: none; } }
</style>
